        <h1>A coach. Every day. <em>For your whole life.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Every morning you receive one key: a short teaching and one small practice. A Vault coach walks the year with you, chamber by chamber: learning from your past, loving your present, and living toward your future.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Vault</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#pricing">See the plans</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">From $149 a month. Your first week is on us.</p>
        
      </div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap"><p class="proof-intro">How it fits together: <b>keys</b> are the lessons, <b>chambers</b> are the parts of your life, <b>gates</b> open as lessons become habits, and your <b>coach</b> walks you through.</p><div class="proof-grid">
<a href="/the-360/"><b>360°</b><span>Keys for the mind</span><em>Short teachings on how you think, feel and relate.</em></a>
<a href="/the-180/"><b>180°</b><span>Keys for the body</span><em>Daily practices to turn your health around.</em></a>
<a href="/method/"><b>11</b><span>Chambers</span><em>The parts of a whole life, from You to Sharing. One at a time.</em></a>
<a href="/method/"><b>9</b><span>Gates</span><em>Each opens when a practice becomes a habit.</em></a>
<a href="#how"><b>1</b><span>Coach</span><em>Your Vault coach, guiding you through all of it.</em></a>
</div></div></div>
