    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">The whole person</p><div class="gallery four"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/body-c.jpg" alt="Russ in a yoga pose on a mat by the water" style="object-position:50% 70%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Body</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473492201326-7c01dd2e596b?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A man smiling as he reads a book outdoors" style="object-position:50% 40%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Mind</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1625690988276-0a7b0cdf3d5d?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="An older couple holding each other and laughing" style="object-position:50% 30%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Heart</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526779259212-939e64788e3c?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A man meditating on a rock at sunset" style="object-position:50% 55%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Soul</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why most self-help fails</p><h2>You don't need more books.<br>You need a plan and a person.</h2></div>
      <div class="quiz"><h3>Thirty seconds: which part of your life is loudest right now?</h3><p>Pick one. Learn from the past, love the present, live toward the future. Your first key comes from the part you choose.</p><div class="opts"><a class="brown" href="/as-learned/"><b>The past · as learned by you</b><i>The learning that frames you.</i>I keep repeating a pattern, and I want to see where it came from so it stops pulling me back.</a><a class="green" href="/as-loved/"><b>The present · as loved by you</b><i>The love that goes into the moment.</i>I want to be fully here for my life and my people, not just getting through the week.</a><a class="navy" href="/as-lived/"><b>The future · as you want to live it</b><i>Living into your possibility.</i>I want to play for a future I choose, and build a legacy worth leaving.</a></div></div>
          </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">Five ways to be coached</p><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/inperson.jpg" alt="Russ reading aloud to a group by a stone fireplace" style="object-position:50% 18%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>One on one</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/retreat.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a mountain meadow" style="object-position:50% 60%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a group</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1761839258657-457dda39b5cc?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family of five standing together in a garden" style="object-position:50% 35%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a family</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team working together around a table with laptops" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a team</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758518730136-1bf4fa26ccbf?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Business leaders talking around a conference table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a business</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec listened" id="listened"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live · Listen</p><h2>The thread through all three.</h2><p class="lede">You learn from your past, love your present and live toward your future. One skill runs through all three: how you listen, to yourself and to the people around you. At its core, Vault Human is communication coaching.</p></div>
      <div class="loop-grid">
        <figure class="loop"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 360" role="img" aria-label="The listening loop: learn from your past, love your present, live into your future, with listening at the center">
          <defs><marker id="ah" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="6" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="var(--acc-soft)"/></marker></defs>
          <circle cx="180" cy="186" r="120" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M226 78 A120 120 0 0 1 292 214" fill="none" stroke="var(--acc-soft)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
          <path d="M250 284 A120 120 0 0 1 110 284" fill="none" stroke="var(--acc-soft)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
          <path d="M68 214 A120 120 0 0 1 134 78" fill="none" stroke="var(--acc-soft)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
          <g font-family="Bebas Neue, Inter, sans-serif" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor">
            <circle cx="180" cy="66" r="46" fill="var(--bg2)" stroke="#C9A98A" stroke-width="2"/><text x="180" y="68" font-size="26">Learn</text><text x="180" y="88" font-size="13" fill-opacity=".75">the past</text>
            <circle cx="284" cy="246" r="46" fill="var(--bg2)" stroke="#9FBF8E" stroke-width="2"/><text x="284" y="248" font-size="26">Love</text><text x="284" y="268" font-size="13" fill-opacity=".75">the present</text>
            <circle cx="76" cy="246" r="46" fill="var(--bg2)" stroke="#9DB7CB" stroke-width="2"/><text x="76" y="248" font-size="26">Live</text><text x="76" y="268" font-size="13" fill-opacity=".75">the future</text>
            <text x="180" y="196" font-size="40" fill="var(--acc-soft)">Listen</text>
          </g>
        </svg></figure>
        <div class="loop-steps">
          <div><h3>Listen to your past</h3><p>Hear your story without being run by it. Reflection turns old patterns into lessons you can use.</p></div>
          <div><h3>Listen to your present</h3><p>Appreciate what is here: your body, your people, this moment. Love is attention, given on purpose.</p></div>
          <div><h3>Listen to your future</h3><p>Lean into what is possible, with optimism and power. Play for the future you choose, starting today.</p></div>
          <div><h3>Create a listening</h3><p>How you listen to yourself, to people and to the world shapes who you become and who they get to be. We help you build a listening that is positive, powerful and kind.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="strip-head" style="margin-top:56px">Creating a listening</p>
      <div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/v2/home-rohr.jpg" alt="Russ leaning in to listen to Father Richard Rohr" style="object-position:50% 0%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>To others</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517971129774-8a2b38fa128e?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A woman writing in a notebook by a window" style="object-position:50% 40%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>To yourself</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1491438590914-bc09fcaaf77a?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Friends laughing and talking together outdoors" style="object-position:50% 40%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>To your world</figcaption></figure></div>
      <div class="trio"><div><h3>Mindfulness</h3><p>Listening to yourself: what your body, your history and your hopes are telling you.</p></div><div><h3>Connectedness</h3><p>Listening to others: hearing the person, not just the words, so they feel understood.</p></div><div><h3>Creativeness</h3><p>Crafting what comes next: how you curate and create yourself, and the room around you.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark vid-sec" id="russ"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/47818/47818-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Founder of Vault Human</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Most coaches sell energy, a system, or a rule. Russ is a practicing attorney and a twenty-year operator who coaches from the whole picture: how you were built, how you are living, and what you intend to leave. Every key you receive was chosen and ordered by him, from a lifetime of learning from the world’s great teachers and traditions.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec coach-sec" id="coaching"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">In the room</p><h2>The work happens face to face.</h2></div>
      <div class="lgrid home"><figure class="big"><video  style="--p:10% 50%;--pm:50% 35%" class="fg slow" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/home-room-poster.jpg" aria-label="Russ coaching a room from the stage"><source src="/img/russ/v2/home-room.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:100% 40%;--pm:70% 40%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-marianne.jpg" alt="Russ on stage with a microphone beside Marianne Williamson" width="1280" height="846" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-burchard.jpg" alt="Russ and Brendon Burchard at High Performance Academy" width="1200" height="869" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-fire.jpg" alt="A men’s circle talking around a campfire at night" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 40%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-forest.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a pine forest" width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 28%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/home-mic.jpg" alt="Russ speaking with a microphone on a lit stage" width="1035" height="1400" loading="lazy" /></figure></div>
    </div></section>
