    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start free. Meet Russ. Choose your plan. The first two steps cost nothing.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Start free</h3><p>Sign up for free access: a welcome letter and short video from Russ, the Daily Key in your inbox, and your first module. No card.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Meet Russ</h3><p>Book a free 30-minute virtual conversation. It is part of your free assessment: no payment, no pitch, just where you are and where to start.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Choose your plan</h3><p>Most people begin with the monthly membership: the year-long coaching modules in the Vault Human portal, plus a live monthly call led by Russ on that month’s chamber.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#daily-key">Start free</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Book the free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="method"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The method</p><h2>Keys, chambers, gates.</h2><p class="lede">Every teaching we use is a key: one idea, who first taught it, and one small practice. The keys sit in eleven chambers, from You to Sharing. When a practice holds, the gate to the next chamber opens.</p></div>
      <div class="mgrid"><a class="mcard" href="/the-360/"><b>360</b><h3>Keys for the mind</h3><p>From Og Mandino and William James to the mystics and the modern greats. Day one: read Mandino’s Scroll One aloud.</p><span>See the 360 →</span></a><a class="mcard" href="/the-180/"><b>180</b><h3>Keys for the body</h3><p>Breath, food, strength, sleep and recovery, each traced to its source. Day one: a walk outside.</p><span>See the 180 →</span></a><a class="mcard" href="/method/"><b>11</b><h3>Chambers</h3><p>You · Body · Awareness · Meaning · Healing · Circle · Rhythm · Freedom · Tomorrow · Service · Sharing.</p><span>How the year runs →</span></a><a class="mcard" href="/method/"><b>9</b><h3>Gates</h3><p>Breathing, attending, making, honoring, connecting, repeating, forgiving, tending, serving.</p><span>How a gate opens →</span></a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>A year, not a weekend.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">For individuals · start here</div><h3>The Keys</h3><div class="price">$149<small>/mo</small></div><p>The monthly membership. The year-long coaching modules in the Vault Human portal, one key every morning, and a live monthly call led by Russ on that month’s chamber.</p><p class="guarantee">Your first week is on us. $1,490 a year if you’d rather. Want a private session every week? Add the Coached Year: $1,750 a month, 12 seats.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For teams and businesses</div><h3>Team coaching</h3><div class="price">From $8,500<small>/mo</small></div><p>Your leaders and your team, coached together on how they learn, lead and listen. Six-month minimum, offered through Triplicity Advisory.</p><p class="guarantee">Scoped with you in a first conversation.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Talk to us</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For families</div><h3>The Family Year</h3><div class="price">Built to suit</div><p>Your household coached together and apart: two generations or three, around the table and one-on-one. Most families start from $3,500 a month.</p><p class="guarantee">Designed with you in a first conversation.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every plan begins the same way: start free, then a free 30-minute conversation with Russ. You never pay for the past, the present or the future. You pay for coaching.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="parts"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Your life, in three parts. One thread.</h2><p class="lede">Which part is loudest right now? Pick one. Your first key comes from there.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="/as-learned/"><div class="when">The past · Learn</div><h3>As Learned</h3><p>How you were wired. What you were taught. What still runs you.</p><span>Life as learned →</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="/as-loved/"><div class="when">The present · Love</div><h3>As Loved</h3><p>The life you're actually in. Being mindful is the work.</p><span>Life as loved →</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="/as-lived/"><div class="when">The future · Live</div><h3>As Lived</h3><p>What you'll leave behind. Purpose, legacy, the plan.</p><span>Life as lived →</span></a><a class="tlc sage" href="#listened"><div class="when">Always · Listen</div><h3>As Listened</h3><p>How you hear yourself and others, and what you create from it. The thread through all three.</p><span>Life as listened →</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">One coach. One method. <a href="/#pricing">One price to start.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Vault Human, in one sentence?</summary><p>Daily coaching: one key every morning, a short teaching and one small practice, walked through the year with Russ as your coach.</p></details><details><summary>What are Fretwork, Triplicity and Tercet?</summary><p>Three companies under the same owner that serve organizations, not members: Fretwork automates business systems, Triplicity sells executive and leadership coaching to companies, Tercet Law does wills, trusts and succession. A Vault Human member never needs any of them.</p></details><details><summary>Is Russ really the coach?</summary><p>Yes. A practicing attorney, a twenty-year operator and board president. He chose and ordered every key, leads the monthly calls, and in 2027 personally coaches eighteen people in the Coached Year. Trainers he certifies begin coaching in 2028.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It is coaching. If you need a therapist, we say so.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>About ten minutes a day. The Coached Year adds an hour a week.</p></details><details><summary>What does the first week cost?</summary><p>Nothing. Your first week of keys is on us. If it is not for you, cancel before day eight and you pay nothing.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Any time, no fee.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

